classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'fr.thegostsniperfr.arffornia.network..'\ and\ have\ simple\ name\ starting\ with\ 'Serverbound'\ and\ are\ not\ nested\ classes\ should\ call\ fr.thegostsniperfr.arffornia.network.ServerPayloadChecks,\ because\ a\ modified\ client\ can\ send\ any\ payload\ at\ any\ time.\ Fix\:\ in\ the\ handler,\ before\ touching\ the\ world,\ call\ fr.thegostsniperfr.arffornia.network.ServerPayloadChecks\ (menu\ open\ and\ matching,\ distance\ <\=\ 8\ blocks,\ ownership,\ unlock\ state)\ and\ return\ early\ when\ it\ fails;\ add\ the\ missing\ check\ to\ that\ helper\ rather\ than\ inlining\ it.=5e5c199f-bb77-4743-b0bf-07702cea1b5a
no\ classes\ that\ not\ client-only\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['net.minecraft.client..',\ 'com.mojang.blaze3d..',\ 'fr.thegostsniperfr.arffornia.client..'],\ because\ a\ dedicated\ server\ has\ no\ client\ classes\ and\ crashes\ with\ NoClassDefFoundError\ when\ common\ code\ touches\ them.\ Fix\:\ move\ the\ client\ part\ into\ a\ class\ under\ fr.thegostsniperfr.arffornia.client\ (or\ a\ @EventBusSubscriber(value\ \=\ Dist.CLIENT)\ class)\ and\ reach\ it\ from\ common\ code\ only\ through\ a\ payload\ handler\ or\ an\ interface\ whose\ client\ implementation\ is\ registered\ from\ the\ client\ entry\ point.\ JEI/compat\ classes\ that\ need\ screens\:\ put\ the\ screen-specific\ part\ in\ a\ client\ subpackage.=2ead5d04-2caf-4bde-a73a-f9b792bed8d7
no\ classes\ that\ not\ on\ the\ literal\ allow-list\ should\ call\ method\ Component.literal(String),\ because\ players\ read\ the\ mod\ in\ English\ and\ French.\ Fix\:\ use\ Component.translatable("<area>.arffornia.<key>",\ args...)\ and\ add\ the\ key\ to\ assets/arffornia/lang/en_us.json\ and\ fr_fr.json;\ style\ with\ ChatFormatting,\ not\ section-sign\ codes.\ Raw\ data\ (numbers,\ names)\ goes\ in\ as\ translatable\ args.=3440d18c-d4df-42f9-95e0-5a32afeed4b0
